# the CD's blitz2 2.10 with the CD's libraries and the reference RWE library
[session]
done
[compile]
ok
[run]
word 0 other
word 1 other
word 2 other
word 3 other
word 4 other
word 5 other
word 6 other
word 7 other
rc=0
[blitz2]
rc=0
[log]
openreq "Blitz Basic 2 Version N.NN"
getinput "Blitz Basic 2 Version N.NN" -> gadget 1 " OKEE DOKEE " (version requester)
BATCH	start
JOB	j000	CORPUS:src/ridisplaylib-cmove-absolute-addresses.bb2
XTRA	j000	defaults
ezfreq "Name of Executable to create" -> CORPUS:out/ridisplaylib-cmove-absolute-addresses
openreq "***** COMPILING *****"
openreq "***** COMPILING *****"
RESULT	j000	ok
BATCH	end
